{"type":"message","id":"02d38acb","parentId":"eb41c7db","timestamp":"2026-04-04T00:09:53.062Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"244KB, 25 files - that's tiny. The user is right, we should back it up. Let me explain why and offer to add it.","thinkingSignature":"86d942179ea6d78afc58aa911d4a6cc54edb694c3752e6b8a06d72607ae6d715"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n你说得对，才 244KB，确实不大。\n\n没备份是我写脚本时的习惯性判断——觉得 memory 是运行时产生的日志，不需要版本控制。但实际上这里有：\n- 每日对话记录\n- 各科辅导的临时分析\n- 兮兮的错题数据摘要\n\n这些挺重要的，应该一起备份。我来改一下脚本加上。\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":3973,"output":111,"cacheRead":38258,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42342,"cost":{"input":0.0011918999999999999,"output":0.00013319999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00229548,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00362058}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775261388839,"responseId":"061f89cd1b1142e21d09933fb67106d0"}}
