{"type":"message","id":"32c8a268","parentId":"0da03383","timestamp":"2026-04-04T00:54:58.895Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the structure of the bitable:\n- 学科 (SingleSelect): 语文/数学/英语/物理/历史/道法/地理/生物\n- 题目内容 (Text)\n- 正确答案 (Text)\n- 错因分析 (Text)\n- 知识点 (MultiSelect): has options including 力与运动/二力平衡/摩擦力/弹力/重力 etc.\n- 难度 (SingleSelect): ⭐/⭐⭐/⭐⭐⭐\n- 录入时间 (DateTime)\n\n\n- 备注 (Text)\n- 原图 (Attachment)\n\nNext I need to extract the specific questions from the PDF, convert the PDF pages to images for each question, and then populate the records with all the metadata and image references.\n\nLooking at the错题记录 table, I have field IDs for 学科 (fldIrrhnml), 题目内容 (fldSwjcHWl), 正确答案 (fldkmnGmjJ), 错因分析 (fldQ0eOyjJ), 知识点 (fldNYHZtsp), 难度 (fldGGB8eo9), and 录入时间 (fld4bf78gg).\n\nI'm mapping out the specific questions to their knowledge points: question 10 covers the relationship between gravity and mass, which falls under both 力与运动 and 重力; question 12 about Newton's first law is categorized under 力与运动; question 14 on inertia and safety protection also relates to 力与运动; and B1 on two-force equilibrium applications is mapped to 二力平衡.\n\nFor the trickier questions, B4 involves friction calculation in stacked objects under 力与运动 and 摩擦力, while B5 covers elastic force and spring mechanics with 弹力. The remaining questions include a force composition calculation, a diagram drawing for gravity and pressure, and a sliding friction experiment design.\n\nI need to convert the PDF pages to images first, then batch create these 9 records. Let me start by extracting and converting the relevant pages from the PDF.","thinkingSignature":"c72d91d1544fd0e1daca10e1e922b6df335058d0c442446a26423617eb897666"},{"type":"text","text":"先把 PDF 按题目截图保存，再录入表格。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nhg7y5yl7rzn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"FILE=\"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/è_²æ_æ_äº_å_å_å¹_çº_ç_ç_ç_ä_å_ç_ç_ä¹_20260312_ç_ç---9ac2698b-e9da-4a30-9204-b3592c66f365.pdf\"\nmkdir -p /tmp/xx错题本截图\n# 查看PDF页数\npython3 -c \"\nimport subprocess\nresult = subprocess.run(['pdfinfo', '$FILE'], capture_output=True, text=True)\nprint(result.stdout)\n\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"pdfinfo not available\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12029,"output":594,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50480,"cost":{"input":0.0036087,"output":0.0007128,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0065929199999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775264085596,"responseId":"061f945623908c066df275854cb10688"}}
