{"type":"message","id":"5ea95dcd","parentId":"9082750c","timestamp":"2026-04-04T01:45:57.025Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The script ran successfully and the Feishu notification was sent. Let me verify the Feishu message was received by checking if 频哥 got the notification.\n\nActually, I won't be able to verify that directly, but the script worked without errors. Let me report back to 频哥 that the feature has been added and tested successfully.","thinkingSignature":"56dd61f3cd14b37947f70b8cf16aa4629aca2f188240b2c350c67eda2f9463f8"},{"type":"text","text":"搞定 ✅\n\n备份脚本已更新，加入了飞书通知功能，今天测试已成功发送。\n\n**效果：** 每天凌晨3点备份完成推送到 GitHub 后，会自动发一条飞书消息给你：\n\n```\n📦 定时备份报告\n✅ GitHub 推送成功\n⏰ 时间：2026-04-04 03:00\n📁 备份内容：配置、Skills、memory\n```\n\n明天凌晨3点你就能收到了。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":26823,"output":168,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64848,"cost":{"input":0.0080469,"output":0.0002016,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010519919999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775267151716,"responseId":"061fa050f4ff1c148add5b7e6f8e5aac"}}
