{"type":"message","id":"06837f31","parentId":"02f1f3bf","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:09:41.779Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API returned an HTML page, which suggests the endpoint might be wrong or the API format is different. Let me check the skill's save/search references to see what endpoints to use.","thinkingSignature":"6bc8f18ece7ff430b31b0ba022cb9ac206f50fd8f338680f45e9986fa2288bd7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3ux1vgs7elfn_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/getnote/references/api-details.md","limit":50}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":33948,"output":90,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71895,"cost":{"input":0.0101844,"output":0.000108,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01256382}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775268578562,"responseId":"061fa5e3c62e131e02f21e4bccd8590e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"691585fe","parentId":"06837f31","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:09:41.809Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3ux1vgs7elfn_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Get笔记 API 详细参考\n\n## 目录\n\n1. [错误码表](#错误码表)\n2. [error.reason 取值表](#errorreason-取值表)\n3. [限流响应结构](#限流响应结构)\n4. [笔记详情独有字段](#笔记详情独有字段)\n5. [新建笔记字段说明](#新建笔记字段说明)\n6. [图片上传凭证返回字段](#图片上传凭证返回字段)\n\n---\n\n## 错误码表\n\n| 错误码 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|\n| 10000 | 参数错误 |\n| 10001 | 鉴权失败 |\n| 10100 | 数据不存在（笔记不存在等）|\n| 10201 | 非会员 |\n| 10202 | QPS 限流 |\n| 30000 | 服务调用失败 |\n| 42900 | 配额限流 |\n| 50000 | 系统错误 |\n\n---\n\n## error.reason 取值表\n\n| reason | 说明 |\n|--------|------|\n| not_member | 非会员，引导开通：https://www.biji.com/checkout?product_alias=6AydVpYeKl |\n| qps_global | 全局 QPS 超限 |\n| qps_bucket | 桶级 QPS 超限 |\n| quota_day | 当日配额用尽 |\n| quota_month | 当月配额用尽 |\n\n---\n\n## 限流响应结构\n\n429 错误时，`error` 字段中包含 `rate_limit` 对象：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": 42900,\n    \"message\": \"rate limited\",\n\n[193 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775268581802}}
{"type":"message","id":"9ba0f77b","parentId":"691585fe","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:09:44.950Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try a different endpoint format. The API returned HTML, which could mean the base URL or endpoint is wrong. Let me look at the skill's save.md to see what API it actually calls.","thinkingSignature":"ad254ca21652eba6a6ca0b66d82544877dd7f583579682031731d4bdda02d0b8"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l9ndu79h6xeq_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/getnote/references/save.md","limit":80}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":34402,"output":94,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72353,"cost":{"input":0.0103206,"output":0.00011279999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012704819999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775268581810,"responseId":"061fa5e6a19cd2e71456c23e92375a4a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"229b5def","parentId":"9ba0f77b","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:09:44.978Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_l9ndu79h6xeq_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 保存笔记\n\n## 概述\n\n新建文本、链接、图片三种类型的笔记。文本笔记同步完成；链接和图片笔记是异步任务，需轮询进度。\n\n---\n\n## 新建笔记\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/save\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n**仅支持新建，不支持编辑**。\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"笔记标题\",\n  \"content\": \"Markdown 内容\",\n  \"note_type\": \"plain_text\",\n  \"tags\": [\"标签1\", \"标签2\"],\n  \"parent_id\": 0,\n  \"link_url\": \"https://...\",\n  \"image_urls\": [\"https://...\"]\n}\n```\n\n详细字段说明见 [api-details.md](api-details.md#新建笔记字段说明)。\n\n- `plain_text`：同步返回，立即完成，响应中包含 `note_id`（字符串）\n- `link` / `img_text`：返回 `task_id`，**必须轮询** `/task/progress`\n\n---\n\n## 查询任务进度\n\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/task/progress\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n请求体：\n```json\n{\"task_id\": \"task_abc123xyz\"}\n```\n\n返回：\n- `status`: `pending` | `processing` | `success` | `failed`\n- `note_id`: 成功时返回笔记 ID（**字符串**）；任务进行中时值为 `\"0\"`，需过滤\n- `error_msg`: 失败时返回错误信息\n\n**建议 10-30 秒间隔轮询，直到 success 或 failed**。\n\n---\n\n## 链接笔记完整流程\n\n> ⚠️ **必须遵循的体验流程**\n\n**步骤 1**：提交任务\n```\nPOST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/save {note_type:\"link\", link_url:\"https://...\"}\n```\n\n返回结构：\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"created_count\": 1,\n    \"tasks\": [{\"task_id\": \"69c3995e99f5a67e\", \"url\": \"https://...\"}],\n    \"message\": \"链接笔记任务已创建，请通过 /note/task/progress 接口查询处理状态\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n⚠️ **task_id 在 `data.tasks[0].task_id`**，不是 `data.task_id`。\n\n\n[66 more lines in file. Use offset=81 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775268584972}}
