{"type":"message","id":"015222f2","parentId":"11211f04","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:26:16.658Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"90 days before April 4, 2026 is January 4, 2026.\n\nThe GetNotes API returns notes sorted by newest first. With 7331 total notes and 20 per page, the earliest notes are at the end. January 4, 2026 is about 3 months ago, so I'd need to go quite deep.\n\nLet me try to calculate how many pages I'd need to get to January 4. The notes seem to have many per day (looking at the data, there are dozens of notes per day). Let me try to iterate through pages until I find notes from around January 4.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. \n\nSince I can't determine the exact daily volume without checking, I'll need to paginate through the API systematically. I'll fetch multiple pages starting from the beginning, which should give me around 20 notes per request, and keep going until I reach notes from around January 4, 2026.","thinkingSignature":"59bd5f05da206459e2884724921696c417ed2fcf805ab4d973f03bceef6a6e4d"},{"type":"text","text":"90天前是 **2026年1月4日**。我翻翻看。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_hm3wx76v78c1_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport subprocess, json, time\n\nAPI_KEY = \"gk_live_9dace17c324ab0c6.41c06a0e5732a5d7447f034d3bbe2082f54a48732dd24685\"\nCLIENT_ID = \"cli_3802f9db08b811f197679c63c078bacc\"\nBASE_URL = \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list\"\n\nnotes_from_jan4 = []\npage = 0\nsince_id = \"0\"\n\nwhile True:\n    page += 1\n    url = f\"{BASE_URL}?since_id={since_id}\"\n    result = subprocess.run(\n        [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"GET\", url,\n         \"-H\", f\"Authorization: {API_KEY}\",\n         \"-H\", f\"X-Client-ID: {CLIENT_ID}\"],\n        capture_output=True, text=True\n    )\n    \n    try:\n        data = json.loads(result.stdout)\n    except:\n        print(f\"Page {page}: JSON解析失败\")\n        break\n    \n    notes = data.get(\"data\", {}).get(\"notes\", [])\n    if not notes:\n        break\n    \n    for note in notes:\n        created_at = note.get(\"created_at\", \"\")\n        # 只保留2026年1月4日的笔记\n        if \"2026-01-04\" in created_at:\n            notes_from_jan4.append(note)\n        # 如果已经早于1月4日，可以停止（假设排序正确）\n        elif created_at < \"2026-01-04\":\n            print(f\"到达 {created_at}，停止遍历\")\n            break\n    \n    has_more = data.get(\"data\", {}).get(\"has_more\", False)\n    next_cursor = data.get(\"data\", {}).get(\"next_cursor\", \"0\")\n    \n    if not has_more or next_cursor == since_id or not notes_from_jan4:\n        break\n    since_id = next_cursor\n    \n    if page % 50 == 0:\n        print(f\"已翻 {page} 页，最早: {notes[-1].get('created_at','')}\")\n    \n    # 避免频率限制\n    time.sleep(0.3)\n\nprint(f\"\\n=== 2026-01-04 的笔记共 {len(notes_from_jan4)} 条 ===\")\nfor n in notes_from_jan4:\n    print(f\"  [{n.get('created_at')}] {n.get('title', '(无标题)')[:50]} | {n.get('note_type','')}\")\nPYEOF"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":70562,"output":793,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109212,"cost":{"input":0.0211686,"output":0.0009515999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02439162}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775269561526,"responseId":"061fa9b9cca3aee8b04e15c59ced15a0"}}
