{"type":"message","id":"01d80208","parentId":"486ea2fa","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:31:12.749Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Actually, running this script would take a long time in the foreground. Let me just run it in the background and let the user know. But the issue is that this would take a very long time to run (185 pages × 0.2s = 37 seconds at minimum, but realistically with API overhead it could be several minutes).\n\nActually, 0.2 seconds per page × 185 pages = 37 seconds. That's actually not too bad. Let me try to run it with a longer timeout.","thinkingSignature":"a652240d3158825f32f121d0dc140c3e6054a3d3d5edb5b8fd30b5dd015819e7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ppcbulha056s_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /tmp/fetch_jan4_notes.py 2>&1","timeout":180}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":84388,"output":154,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":122399,"cost":{"input":0.0253164,"output":0.0001848,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.027772619999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775269867475,"responseId":"061faaec0ab7f3da8311604aabaa049a"}}
