{"type":"message","id":"83145e1a","parentId":"0f607a8a","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:31:57.847Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_9agg0wwoxcy3_1","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Page 20: 2026-03-02 ~ 2026-02-28 | 已找到 0 条\nPage 36: 已过目标日期 [2025-12-29]，停止\n\n=== 2026-01-04 共 2 条笔记 ===\n[2026-01-04 13:16:02] AI经济中的技能暴露度（替代度）测量（MIT研究 快刀717期有解读）\n[2026-01-04 08:42:18] 2026让AI给我打工的玩法\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"wild-pine","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"Page 20: 2026-03-02 ~ 2026-02-28 | 已找到 0 条\nPage 36: 已过目标日期 [2025-12-29]，停止\n\n=== 2026-01-04 共 2 条笔记 ===\n[2026-01-04 13:16:02] AI经济中的技能暴露度（替代度）测量（MIT研究 快刀717期有解读）\n[2026-01-04 08:42:18] 2026让AI给我打工的玩法\n","name":"python3 /tmp/fetch_jan4_notes.py"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775269917839}}
