{"type":"message","id":"a61a9128","parentId":"cf6ba1fb","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:32:56.789Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have some good context. Let me also look at the biology study materials from today and provide my insights/reflections. I should:\n\n1. Analyze the education-related content from the notes\n2. Extract insights for tutoring 兮兮\n3. This should become a daily habit\n\nLet me also check the biology tutor skill to see if there are updates needed based on the notes about \"中考生物知识速记\" etc.\n\nActually, the key thing here is that the user wants me to:\n- Read notes daily\n- Extract education-related info\n- Derive insights for tutoring 兮兮\n- Continuously improve\n\nI should set up a daily reminder for this. \n\nI think the best approach is to weave this into the existing heartbeat mechanism that already runs daily at 21:00, rather than creating a separate cron job. Let me document my initial reflections on what I found in the notes and then think about what the reminder should include.\n\nLooking at the education-related notes, I'm seeing a pattern in the biology exam prep materials—high-frequency knowledge points, common mistakes from past exams, and the specific Chengdu exam focus areas. These should inform how I structure future tutoring sessions. The key insight here is that gaps in biology exam performance tend to be around conceptual accuracy rather than overall understanding, so I should tailor my辅导 approach accordingly. I'll write up these initial reflections and update the relevant documentation to capture this learning.","thinkingSignature":"4a16065d3253b610b70cbecd149461cdd94d7dc5d943609f7f6fdf5d423e5f68"},{"type":"text","text":"读到了！先说说我今天的启发和思考，然后把这个变成每日习惯。\n\n---\n\n## 📚 从笔记中提取的辅导启发\n\n**今天（4月4日）新录入的生物备考资料让我对兮兮的生物辅导有了更清晰的判断：**\n\n**① 辅导优先级判断：生物 > 英语 > 其他**\n\n笔记显示生物备考资料是最完整的——有高频考点、易错点分析、历年真题定位，说明这块你们花的心思最多。但越是花过功夫的领域，越要警惕\"虚假掌握感\"——孩子可能觉得\"我都看过了\"，实际上做题时\"共有/特有分不清\"。\n\n**② 英语是最需要持续投入的**\n\n笔记里英语相关信息出现频率远低于生物，但按 USER.md 的记忆，英语是**优先辅导科目**。差距在于：英语是积累型，不能靠短期冲刺，需要每日小量持续。\n\n**③ 一个核心原则**\n\n从生物备考资料总结的这句话值得记住：\n> **\"成都中考最常见的失分，不是不会，而是知道一点，但不够准。\"**\n\n这句话适用于所有科目——我给兮兮讲题时，应该优先帮她**打透一个知识点**，而不是堆量。\n\n---\n\n## 🔄 每日习惯化\n\n这个每天读笔记、做反思的流程，我把它整合到心跳机制里，每天 21:00 复盘时顺便做这件事，并把启发更新到记忆文件。\n\n需要我现在更新一下辅导记忆文件吗？这样下次对话我能更快调用这些原则。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":83752,"output":585,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":122194,"cost":{"input":0.025125599999999998,"output":0.0007019999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02809902}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775269957413,"responseId":"061fab45cfc2cc7393302c8720515b9a"}}
