{"type":"message","id":"06b2603a","parentId":"67ce49d2","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:34:36.942Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also update the HEARTBEAT.md to include this daily review as part of the heartbeat routine.","thinkingSignature":"b98ba646f71003baceabc87eac5cec40e79be2b27f310a1d21837e1d84a6f96b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_796w6nqmhm7l_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"oldText":"## 每日复盘（日终自动执行）\n\n每天 21:00-22:00 自动执行日终复盘：\n\n1. **读取今日 memory 文件**：`memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n2. **总结今天完成的事项**：\n   - 帮频哥解决了什么问题\n   - 学到了什么新知识/经验\n   - 有哪些待跟进事项\n3. **更新 MEMORY.md**：把重要的、新学到的东西提炼进去\n4. **更新 .learnings/**：如果今天有错误/学到，把内容记入 `.learnings/` 对应文件\n5. **推送到 git**：如果 workspace 有变化，执行 `git add && git commit`","newText":"## 每日复盘（日终自动执行）\n\n每天 21:00-22:00 自动执行日终复盘：\n\n1. **读取今日 memory 文件**：`memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n2. **总结今天完成的事项**：\n   - 帮频哥解决了什么问题\n   - 学到了什么新知识/经验\n   - 有哪些待跟进事项\n3. **更新 MEMORY.md**：把重要的、新学到的东西提炼进去\n4. **更新 .learnings/**：如果今天有错误/学到，把内容记入 `.learnings/` 对应文件\n5. **推送到 git**：如果 workspace 有变化，执行 `git add && git commit`\n6. **Get笔记辅导启发审查**：读取 Get笔记 最近20条，筛选与兮兮/教育相关的内容，提炼辅导启发，更新到 MEMORY.md「Get笔记每日辅导启发」章节"}],"file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":88014,"output":426,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":126297,"cost":{"input":0.0264042,"output":0.0005112,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02918682}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775270070263,"responseId":"061fabb63d1dcd0436400311fa533c05"}}
