{"type":"message","id":"2ff36f31","parentId":"55add88d","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:39:45.037Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to confirm if there are any notes around December 7th, 2025 by using the list API pagination. I know the earliest notes are from 2025-09-22, and the user wants to know about 2025-12-07. \n\nThe notes are sorted from newest to oldest. To find December 7, 2025, I need to go back through the pages. Since we're currently at April 4, 2026 and the notes span about 178 days, going back 101 days would be around late December 2025 / early January 2026.\n\nFrom earlier we know:\n\n\n- The notes currently extend from April 4, 2026 back to September 22, 2025, covering roughly 178 days\n- December 7 would fall somewhere in the middle of this range, so I need to paginate backward from the most recent entries to locate it\n- I should write a Python script to handle the pagination and find notes from around December 7, 2025","thinkingSignature":"1ce02f8d6083a58f7f4f67e57481307d80bf062badd5e78402b01248cade6ae4"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9tns1ues9v2d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat << 'EOF' > /tmp/find_dec7.py\nimport subprocess, json, time, sys\n\nAPI_KEY = \"gk_live_9dace17c324ab0c6.41c06a0e5732a5d7447f034d3bbe2082f54a48732dd24685\"\nCLIENT_ID = \"cli_3802f9db08b811f197679c63c078bacc\"\nBASE_URL = \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list\"\n\ntarget = \"2025-12-07\"\nsince_id = \"0\"\npage = 0\n\nwhile True:\n    page += 1\n    url = f\"{BASE_URL}?since_id={since_id}\"\n    result = subprocess.run(\n        [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"GET\", url,\n         \"-H\", f\"Authorization: {API_KEY}\",\n         \"-H\", f\"X-Client-ID: {CLIENT_ID}\"],\n        capture_output=True, text=True\n    )\n    try:\n        data = json.loads(result.stdout)\n    except:\n        print(f\"Page {page}: JSON解析失败\", file=sys.stderr)\n        break\n    \n    notes = data.get(\"data\", {}).get(\"notes\", [])\n    if not notes:\n        break\n    \n    newest = notes[0].get(\"created_at\", \"\")[:10]\n    oldest = notes[-1].get(\"created_at\", \"\")[:10]\n    \n    # 12月7日在范围内\n    if newest <= target <= oldest:\n        print(f\"在第{page}页范围内: {newest} ~ {oldest}\")\n        for note in notes:\n            created = note.get(\"created_at\", \"\")[:10]\n            if \"2025-12-06\" <= created <= \"2025-12-08\":\n                title = (note.get(\"title\") or note.get(\"content\",\"\")[:50]).replace(\"\\n\",\" \")\n                print(f\"  [{note.get('created_at')}] {title}\")\n        break\n    elif oldest < target:\n        print(f\"第{page}页已过目标，最旧: {oldest}，目标: {target}，无12月7日笔记\")\n        break\n    \n    has_more = data.get(\"data\", {}).get(\"has_more\", False)\n    next_cursor = data.get(\"data\", {}).get(\"next_cursor\", \"0\")\n    if not has_more or next_cursor == since_id:\n        break\n    since_id = next_cursor\n    time.sleep(0.2)\n    \n    if page % 20 == 0:\n        print(f\"已翻{page}页: {newest} ~ {oldest}\", file=sys.stderr)\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/find_dec7.py 2>&1","yieldMs":110000,"timeout":120}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":851,"cacheRead":129494,"cacheWrite":5365,"totalTokens":135840,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0010211999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0077696399999999995,"cacheWrite":0.002011875,"total":0.010841714999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775270366074,"responseId":"061facdeb8a35760d6f09bb43c3bcc9a"}}
