{"type":"message","id":"199d1a98","parentId":"a606c700","timestamp":"2026-04-04T02:48:48.421Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a complex task that requires multiple sub-agents. I should spawn several agents to analyze the notes in parallel. The user has 7331 notes spanning 178 days. I need to:\n\n1. First get an overview of the notes - categorize them\n2. Analyze daily recording trends\n3. Extract insights per category\n\nLet me think about the best approach:\n1. I should read the notes in batches using multiple agents\n2. Each agent can analyze a portion of the notes\n3. Then I can synthesize their findings\n\nHowever, given the large number of notes (7331), reading all of them would be expensive. Let me think about a smarter approach:\n\n\nRather than reading everything, I could use the recall API to fetch different categories and analyze representative samples, or sample systematically across the entire period to identify patterns and trends. Let me start by getting a broader sample from the recall results and having sub-agents focus on specific categories like work content, education insights, investment observations, and AI tools, then compile the daily trends from the full dataset.","thinkingSignature":"618699022fdd3b4bd437bfc5167facef2059c38cab233d52759a28c329ed3752"},{"type":"text","text":"这个任务比较大，我拆成多个子 Agent 并行分析不同维度：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5qhpc7k1pp61_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"分析 Get笔记 的笔记类型分类。\n\n读取 Get笔记 最近200条（翻第1-10页），每条读取标题和内容前200字，统计笔记类型分布。\n\n输出格式：\n1. **笔记类型分布表**：列出每种 note_type（如 plain_text/recorder_audio/img_text/link 等）出现次数\n2. **来源分布**：统计 source 字段（knowledge/openapi/app/dedao 等）出现次数\n3. **标签分布**：统计 tags 出现频次\n4. **主要内容主题**：总结最常见的内容主题（工作/教育/投资/AI/生活等）及其占比\n\nAPI信息：\n- API Key: gk_live_9dace17c324ab0c6.41c06a0e5732a5d7447f034d3bbe2082f54a48732dd24685\n- Client ID: cli_3802f9db08b811f197679c63c078bacc\n- Base URL: https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=0（每次翻页用返回的 next_cursor）","label":"note-type-classify","runtime":"subagent"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5qhpc7k1pp61_2","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"分析 Get笔记 的每日记录趋势。\n\n读取 Get笔记 全部7331条笔记的日期信息（只需要每页的第一条和最后一条笔记的日期，不需要完整内容）。\n\n具体做法：\n1. 从 since_id=0 开始翻页，每翻一页记录：页码、最新日期、最旧日期、该页笔记数量\n2. 统计：\n   - 共有多少天有记录\n   - 记录密度最高的是哪几天/哪几周\n   - 是否有明显的记录空白期（连续3天以上无记录）\n   - 日均记录条数\n3. 给出按月统计的笔记数量趋势（哪个月记最多，哪个月最少）\n\nAPI信息：\n- API Key: gk_live_9dace17c324ab0c6.41c06a0e5732a5d7447f034d3bbe2082f54a48732dd24685\n- Client ID: cli_3802f9db08b811f197679c63c078bacc\n- Base URL: https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=XXX（每次翻页用返回的 next_cursor）\n- 注意：每页20条，翻完全部约367页，需要间隔0.2秒避免限流","label":"note-trend-analysis","runtime":"subagent"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5qhpc7k1pp61_3","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"从 Get笔记 中提取跟孩子教育相关的所有笔记，并做分析。\n\n用 recall 语义搜索接口，搜索以下关键词，获取相关笔记并分析：\n1. 搜索\"兮兮 女儿 教育\"获取跟兮兮相关的内容\n2. 搜索\"英语学习 时态 初中\"获取英语学习方法\n3. 搜索\"中考 备考 初中\"获取中考相关\n4. 搜索\"学习方法 习惯 培养\"获取学习方法类\n\n对每条笔记提取：\n- 标题、日期、来源\n- 核心观点（50字内）\n- 对辅导兮兮的实际启发（20字内）\n\n汇总输出：\n1. **兮兮教育相关笔记列表**（按日期排序）\n2. **英语学习方法要点**（从笔记中提炼）\n3. **中考备考建议**（从笔记中提炼）\n4. **对我辅导工作的启发**（最核心的3条）\n\nAPI信息：\n- API Key: gk_live_9dace17c324ab0c6.41c06a0e5732a5d7447f034d3bbe2082f54a48732dd24685\n- Client ID: cli_3802f9db08b811f197679c63c078bacc\n- Recall URL: POST https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/recall\n- 请求体: {\"query\": \"关键词\", \"top_k\": 10}","label":"note-education-insights","runtime":"subagent"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5qhpc7k1pp61_4","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"从 Get笔记 中分析投资理财相关的内容。\n\n用 recall 语义搜索接口，搜索以下内容并分析：\n1. 搜索\"投资 理财 股票\"获取投资相关\n2. 搜索\"黄金 巴菲特 投资策略\"获取\n3. 搜索\"宏观经济 政策 市场\"获取\n4. 搜索\"半导体 芯片 行业\"获取\n\n对每条笔记提取：\n- 日期、标题\n- 核心观点（80字内）\n\n汇总输出：\n1. **投资相关笔记总览**（列出每条笔记的日期、标题、核心观点）\n2. **主要投资观点分类**：分为（A股/美股/黄金/宏观经济/半导体等）\n3. **频哥的投资偏好分析**（根据笔记判断偏向什么风格）\n\nAPI信息：\n- API Key: gk_live_9dace17c324ab0