{"type":"message","id":"738c40e0","parentId":"da90c8c8","timestamp":"2026-04-04T05:54:24.252Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to record a geography wrong question about Singapore's location. But wait - is this actually a geography \"wrong question\"? Singapore is a country/ city-state in Southeast Asia. This seems like a very basic question. \n\nLet me think about this. The user says \"记录一个地理错题：新加坡在哪？\" (Record a geography wrong question: Where is Singapore?). This might be a simple question that 某xi got wrong, or it could be a test question.\n\nI should ask for more context - like the full question and answer, which exam it came from, etc. But wait - I should probably just ask for the details needed to record it properly in the bitable. \n\nI need to get the full context of what the wrong answer was and which exam this came from so I can properly categorize and record it in the bitable.","thinkingSignature":"2b21f6e069c671df0b5a59512c70966684da11ebfb03d294e72f35ac7338b91b"},{"type":"text","text":"需要几条补充信息才能准确录入：\n\n1. **完整题目和正确答案**是什么？兮兮选了哪个答案？\n2. **哪次考试/练习**的题目？（如：xxx试卷 2026-xx-xx）\n3. **原图**需要上传吗？还是文字录入就行？\n\n先把题目发我，我来识别和整理。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":245,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":165264,"totalTokens":165639,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.000294,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.061974,"total":0.062307}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775282048489,"responseId":"061fda81b78de82225dd5bb19ecc67b0"}}
{"type":"message","id":"89df33aa","parentId":"738c40e0","timestamp":"2026-04-04T06:11:00.843Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63ea8721-c0d7-45c4-a2d6-0d1600648a70.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63ea8721-c0d7-45c4-a2d6-0d1600648a70.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-04-04 14:10:58 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b523ef9d774a4c2e7b1e19075d7e, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523ef9d774a4c2e7b1e19075d7e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-04 14:10 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63ea8721-c0d7-45c4-a2d6-0d1600648a70.jpg"}],"timestamp":1775283060813}}
{"type":"message","id":"c5d506c1","parentId":"89df33aa","timestamp":"2026-04-04T06:11:12.804Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent an image for a geography wrong question about Singapore. Let me analyze the image first.","thinkingSignature":"16f1e3ec24220adb8f69b84d9c75e6ab756f6e6800baa624a3dd40b5e621cbbf"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_r8mbuvvp1miq_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请识别这张图片中的地理题目完整内容，包括题目文字、选项（如有）、图表信息，以及任何可见的标记或批注。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63ea8721-c0d7-45c4-a2d6-0d1600648a70.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":117,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":165803,"totalTokens":166050,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0001404,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.062176125,"total":0.062355525}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775283060839,"responseId":"061fde75217bb9411a42390209feb261"}}
{"type":"message","id":"27f50c27","parentId":"c5d506c1","timestamp":"2026-04-04T06:11:32.783Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_r8mbuvvp1miq_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片包含了一道完整的地理题目，主要内容是关于亚欧大陆地理特征、气候及河流的综合分析。\n\n### **题目背景**\n**4. 下图为亚欧两大洲四城市气温曲线和降水量柱状图。读图完成下列问题。**\n\n### **图表信息**\n*   **地图：** 显示了亚洲和欧洲的大部分地区，标注了四大洋（大西洋、北冰洋、印度洋、太平洋）以及重要海域（地中海、黑海、里海）。地图上用字母 A、B、C、D 标注了四个位置。\n*   **气候图：** 提供了四个地点的月平均气温曲线和月降水量柱状图。\n    *   **左上图 (A)：** 全年温和湿润，气温年较差小，降水均匀（对应伦敦的温带海洋性气候）。\n    *   **右上图 (B)：** 夏季高温多雨，冬季寒冷干燥（对应北京的温带季风气候）。\n    *   **左下图 (C)：** 全年高温多雨（对应新加坡的热带雨林气候）。\n    *   **右下图 (D)：** 夏季炎热干燥，冬季温和多雨（对应罗马的地中海气候）。\n\n---\n\n### **题目内容与手写答案识别**\n\n**(1) 亚洲与欧洲的分界线为：____, ____, ____, ____, ____, ____。写出一个地跨亚、欧两大洲的国家：____。**\n*   **手写答案：** 乌拉尔山、乌拉尔河、里海、大高加索山脉、黑海、土耳其海峡；俄罗斯。\n*   *注：图片中手写填空漏掉了一个“黑海”，通常分界线包含六个地理事物。*\n\n**(2) 从位置上看，亚洲被 ____、____ 和 ____ (填特殊纬线名称)、北极圈穿过，地跨 ____、____ 和 ____ (填热量带)，气温 ____ (选填“东西”或“南北”) 差异大，气候类型复杂多样。新加坡气候的特征是 ____。**\n*   **手写答案：** 赤道、北回归线；热带、北温带、北寒带；南北；全年高温多雨。\n\n**(3) 图中甲地形区是 ____，它位于亚洲中部。受地势影响，亚洲河流呈放射状注入周边的海洋，中国大部分河流向 ____ (方向) 流入海洋。北京地区的河流汛期在 ____ (季节)。**\n*   **手写答案：** 青藏高原；东；夏季。\n\n**(4) 夏季，罗马游客爆满，有许多来自伦敦准备前往地中海沿岸享受阳光沙滩的游客。请从伦敦、罗马两地气候角度分析其原因：____。**\n*   **手写答案：** 伦敦属于温带海洋性气候，全年温暖湿润，而罗马是地中海气候，夏季高温干燥，阳光充足，伦敦缺少阳光沙滩的体验，所以夏季罗马有很多伦敦游客。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63ea8721-c0d7-45c4-a2d6-0d1600648a70.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775283092764}}
{"type":"message","id":"c4f243ad","parentId":"27f50c27","timestamp":"2026-04-04T06:11:45.871Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The image shows a geography question about:\n1. The boundary between Asia and Europe\n2. Geographic features of Asia and Singapore climate\n3. Topography of Asia (Qinghai-Tibet Plateau) and rivers\n4. Climate comparison between London and Rome\n\nBut the title says \"新加坡在哪？\" - The user is asking specifically about Singapore's location. Looking at the image more carefully, I see this is a comprehensive geography exam question, and question (2) specifically asks about Singapore's climate characteristics (\"新加坡气候的特征是____\").\n \nSo this is a wrong question entry from XiXi's geography exam—the parent sent this to have it recorded in the wrong questions database. I need to capture all four sub-questions, their answers, and the key knowledge points about Asian geography and climate classification for the bitable record. I'm working through the specific knowledge points this question covers: Singapore's tropical rainforest climate characteristics, the major geographic boundaries and transcontinental countries between Asia and Europe, and how Asia's topography and river systems function. I should also note the climate patterns that distinguish London and Rome. The image shows XiXi's handwritten answers versus the correct responses, so I can identify where the mistakes occurred.","thinkingSignature":"ca70e583cdd96466a357e02b079e43942fc6d5efc35eeb0cfd85978ef1bf3b62"},{"type":"text","text":"图片识别到了！这是一道亚欧大陆综合题，第(2)问涉及新加坡。我来整理录入：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7lnp52a4b8sn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/63ea8721-c0d7-45c4-a2d6-0d1600648a70.jpg /var/folders/8r/0b88l2d52ys5974p0fms08mr0000gn/T/xi_geo_dec7.jpg && echo \"ok\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":128796,"output":366,"cacheRead":37857,"cach