{"type":"message","id":"0197a378","parentId":"3ef3dacc","timestamp":"2026-04-04T08:19:00.237Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to update the record. The Bitable API supports updating records with multiple attachment files in a single field by passing an array of objects with file_token.\n\nHowever, I need to be careful here - if I update the \"原图\" field with the new file_token, it will replace the existing PDF attachment. I need to include both the existing PDF and the new image.\n\nLet me update the record with both attachments:\n- Original PDF: SEY4bt2t1o2dupx13EtcyGrDnzm\n- New image: W5c4b9ak2oDBpPxsDrocIufbn1T","thinkingSignature":"b77a3003607ecf19b045c4e25699de8faf050594d1a45a9bbdb47e19d91ba389"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ez0wuif7yrvj_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"update","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","fields":{"原图":[{"file_token":"SEY4bt2t1o2dupx13EtcyGrDnzm"},{"file_token":"W5c4b9ak2oDBpPxsDrocIufbn1T"}]},"record_id":"recvfMo5a2S4uS"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":116114,"output":297,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":154268,"cost":{"input":0.034834199999999996,"output":0.0003564,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03746202}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775290733436,"responseId":"061ffc6de04581d88064329fd827d4fc"}}
