{"type":"message","id":"ddd58327","parentId":"7983e09c","timestamp":"2026-04-04T08:22:16.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 9 records have been updated. 8 questions (12, 14, B1, B4, B5, 23-1, 26, 29-1) are marked as \"✅ 2026-04-04下午重做，全对\" and question 10 is marked as \"❌ 仍然做错\".","thinkingSignature":"e5fd3fe550781202c781ea1d3bf80cd825164e652ce6dd8e39f270e475e2dcef"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ 全部更新完成！\n\n**今日错题重做结果：**\n\n| 题号 | 知识点 | 结果 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| 10 | 探究重力与质量的关系 | ❌ 仍做错 |\n| 12 | 牛顿第一定律 | ✅ 全对 |\n| 14 | 惯性与安全防护 | ✅ 全对 |\n| B1 | 二力平衡 | ✅ 全对 |\n| B4 | 摩擦力叠加体 | ✅ 全对 |\n| B5 | 弹力与弹簧 | ✅ 全对 |\n| 23-1 | 力的合成计算 | ✅ 全对 |\n| 26 | 重力&压力示意图 | ✅ 全对 |\n| 29-1 | 滑动摩擦力实验 | ✅ 全对 |\n\n**8/9 做对了**，只有第10题（重力实验）仍然卡住——说明\"弹力vs重力\"的区别还没真正理解，下次需要重点突破。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":131412,"output":271,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":169540,"cost":{"input":0.039423599999999996,"output":0.0003252,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04202022}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775290928520,"responseId":"061ffd30829f1a62314e5b9105baa02c"}}
