{"type":"message","id":"c9989f65","parentId":"bc1345fc","timestamp":"2026-04-04T08:23:12.119Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking how I updated the records in the multi-dimensional table. They might be curious about the technical process - how I knew which records to update and how I performed the batch_update. Let me explain the process.","thinkingSignature":"f01adc8e2b6748b5210f882a732376bbb905536dab6af84256ff5152b65e01c7"},{"type":"text","text":"\n通过飞书 Bitable API 操作的，具体过程：\n\n**① 查找记录**\n\n先调 `record.list` 接口扫描全部 43 条记录，根据\"题目内容\"字段匹配到这 9 道题对应的 record_id（比如第10题对应 `recvfMo5a2S4uS`，第12题对应 `recvfMo5a2LyC7`）\n\n**② 上传图片**\n\n用 `feishu_doc_media` action=`bitable_upload`，先把兮兮的做题图片从本地复制到 `/tmp/` 再上传，返回 file_token\n\n**③ 更新备注字段**\n\n用 `record.batch_update` 一次性更新 9 条记录，把每条的\"备注\"字段从原来内容改为\"✅ 2026-04-04下午重做，全对\"（第10题改为❌仍做错）\n\n飞书 Bitable 的\"备注\"字段是**文本类型**，直接传字符串就能覆盖更新，不需要单独调用字段接口。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":248,"cacheRead":166910,"cacheWrite":2445,"totalTokens":169733,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.00029759999999999997,"cacheRead":0.010014599999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000916875,"total":0.011268074999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775290981090,"responseId":"061ffd65bbaff2e60ebad8f2a41f62f5"}}
