{"type":"message","id":"ae0d3d50","parentId":"58d55aab","timestamp":"2026-04-04T12:42:36.473Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"频哥问的对，现在每次备份是直接复制文件到 .backup 目录然后 git add/commit/push，但没有打包。如果要恢复，需要从 git 一个个下载文件。\n\n更好的方式是：\n1. 先把要备份的内容打成 tar.gz 或 zip 包\n2. 然后 commit/push 这个压缩包\n\n这样恢复的时候只需要解压就行了。\n\n我来修改备份脚本，加入打包步骤。","thinkingSignature":"e34d2f2031c4d8e7724a4ff56a47617dc42d1de54c209d2151cbc53ce425a97e"},{"type":"text","text":"说得对，现在直接 git add 文件，颗粒度散、恢复麻烦。改成打包再存 GitHub，恢复时只需解压就行：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_etj5pw92bd5r_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":144,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":176773,"totalTokens":177047,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0001728,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.066289875,"total":0.066501675}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775306541893,"responseId":"06203a2e7e60d01d14aa759baed39e47"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3a7aef46","parentId":"ae0d3d50","timestamp":"2026-04-04T12:42:36.526Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_etj5pw92bd5r_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/bin/bash\n# openclaw-backup.sh - 每天备份 OpenClaw 关键配置文件\n# 使用方法: 加入 crontab: 0 3 * * * /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh\n\nWORKSPACE=\"$HOME/.openclaw/workspace\"\nBACKUP_DIR=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup\"\nOPENCLAW_DIR=\"$HOME/.openclaw\"\nLOG_FILE=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\nSTATUS=\"✅ 备份成功\"\n\necho \"📦 开始备份... $(date)\"\n\n# 清理旧备份\nrm -rf \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\n\n# ===== OpenClaw 配置文件（不含 node_modules） =====\necho \"📁 备份 OpenClaw 配置...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/openclaw.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/exec-approvals.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/wechat-access-auth.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# 备份关键目录（排除 node_modules）\nfor dir in identity credentials agents subagents; do\n  if [ -d \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\" ]; then\n    mkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir\"\n    cp -r \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\"/* \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir/\" 2>/dev/null\n  fi\ndone\n\n# ===== Skills（用户创建的） =====\necho \"📁 备份 Skills...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/skills\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/*.skill \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== memory 文件（对话记录、每日分析） =====\necho \"📁 备份 memory...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/memory\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== Git 操作 =====\ncd \"$WORKSPACE\"\necho \"📝 提交变更...\"\ngit add .backup/ .gitignore scripts/ memory/ -f\ngit commit -m \"backup: $(date +%Y-%m-%d\\ %H:%M)\" --quiet 2>/dev/null\n\n# 推送\necho \"🚀 推送到 GitHub...\"\nPUSH_RESULT=$(git push origin main 2>&1)\nPUSH_EXIT=$?\n\nif [ $PUSH_EXIT -ne 0 ]; then\n    STATUS=\"❌ 备份失败\"\n    echo \"$STATUS: $PUSH_RESULT\" | tee -a \"$LOG_FILE\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\necho \"✅ 备份完成: $(date)\" | tee -a \"$LOG_FILE\"\n\n# ===== 发送飞书通知 =====\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport subprocess, json, sys, os\n\n# 飞书应用配置 - 从 openclaw.json 读取\nAPP_ID = \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3\"\nCONFIG_FILE = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\")\nwith open(CONFIG_FILE) as f:\n    feishu_cfg = json.load(f).get(\"channels\", {}).get(\"feishu\", {})\nAPP_SECRET = feishu_cfg.get(\"appSecret\", \"\")\n\nUSER_OPEN_ID = \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\"\n\n# 获取 app_access_token\nresult = subprocess.run(\n    [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n     \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n     \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n     \"-d\", json.dumps({\"app_id\": APP_ID, \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET})],\n    capture_output=True, text=True\n)\ntoken_data = json.loads(result.stdout)\napp_token = token_data.get(\"tenant_access_token\", \"\")\n\nif not app_token:\n    print(\"获取 token 失败，跳过通知\")\n    sys.exit(0)\n\n# 发送消息\nimport datetime\nnow = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M\")\nmsg = f\"📦 定时备份报告\\n\\n✅ GitHub 推送成功\\n⏰ 时间：{now}\\n📁 备份内容：配置、Skills、memory\"\n\nresult = subprocess.run(\n    [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n     \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n     \"-H\", f\"Authorization: Bearer {app_token}\",\n     \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n     \"-d\", json.dumps({\n         \"receive_id\": USER_OPEN_ID,\n         \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n         \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": msg})\n     })],\n    capture_output=True, text=True\n)\nprint(\"飞书通知已发送\")\nPYEOF\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775306556517}}
{"type":"message","id":"619fd1ca","parentId":"3a7aef46","timestamp":"2026-04-04T12:42:57.695Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我需要修改备份脚本，增加打包步骤：1. 把 .backup 目录打包成 tar.gz2. 同时打包 memory 目录3. git add 打包后的 .tar.gz 文件而不是散文件这样恢复时只需要下载 .tar.gz 然后解压即可。","thinkingSignature":"a4597c2ac3502f16a7419b355214296941db108978f9235434448a03db8f8137"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3azpzdybt60s_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh","content":"#!/bin/bash\n# openclaw-backup.sh - 每天备份 OpenClaw 关键配置文件\n# 使用方法: 加入 crontab: 0 3 * * * /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/openclaw-backup.sh\n\nWORKSPACE=\"$HOME/.openclaw/workspace\"\nBACKUP_DIR=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup\"\nOPENCLAW_DIR=\"$HOME/.openclaw\"\nLOG_FILE=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\nSTATUS=\"✅ 备份成功\"\nDATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n\necho \"📦 开始备份... $DATE\"\n\n# 清理旧备份\nrm -rf \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\n\n# ===== OpenClaw 配置文件（不含 node_modules） =====\necho \"📁 备份 OpenClaw 配置...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/openclaw.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\"\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/exec-approvals.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/wechat-access-auth.json\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# 备份关键目录（排除 node_modules）\nfor dir in identity credentials agents subagents; do\n  if [ -d \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\" ]; then\n    mkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir\"\n    cp -r \"$OPENCLAW_DIR/$dir\"/* \"$BACKUP_DIR/openclaw/$dir/\" 2>/dev/null\n  fi\ndone\n\n# ===== Skills（用户创建的） =====\necho \"📁 备份 Skills...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/skills\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/*.skill \"$BACKUP_DIR/skills/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== memory 文件（对话记录、每日分析） =====\necho \"📁 备份 memory...\"\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory\"\ncp -r \"$WORKSPACE/memory\" \"$BACKUP_DIR/memory/\" 2>/dev/null\n\n# ===== 打包成 tar.gz =====\ncd \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\necho \"📦 打包...\"\nBACKUP_TAR=\"$WORKSPACE/openclaw_backup_${DATE}.tar.gz\"\ntar -czf \"$BACKUP_TAR\" openclaw skills memory 2>/dev/null\nTAR_SIZE=$(du -h \"$BACKUP_TAR\" | cut -f1)\necho \"📦 打包完成: $TAR_SIZE\"\n\n# ===== Git 操作 =====\ncd \"$WORKSPACE\"\necho \"📝 提交变更...\"\n\n# 只提交打包文件 + .gitignore + 脚本（删除旧的散文件 commit）\ngit add \".backup/openclaw_backup_${DATE}.tar.gz\" .gitignore scripts/ -f\n\n# 提交 memory 的增量变化（单独 commit，方便查看 diff）\ngit add \"memory/\" -f\ngit commit -m \"backup: $DATE (memory增量)\" --quiet 2>/dev/null\n\n# 推送\necho \"🚀 推送到 GitHub...\"\nPUSH_RESULT=$(git push origin main 2>&1)\nPUSH_EXIT=$?\n\nif [ $PUSH_EXIT -ne 0 ]; then\n    STATUS=\"❌ 备份失败\"\n    echo \"$STATUS: $PUSH_RESULT\" | tee -a \"$LOG_FILE\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\necho \"✅ 备份完成: $(date)\" | tee -a \"$LOG_FILE\"\n\n# ===== 发送飞书通知 =====\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport subprocess, json, sys, os\n\nAPP_ID = \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3\"\nCONFIG_FILE = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\")\nwith open(CONFIG_FILE) as f:\n    feishu_cfg = json.load(f).get(\"channels\", {}).get(\"feishu\", {})\nAPP_SECRET = feishu_cfg.get(\"appSecret\", \"\")\nUSER_OPEN_ID = \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\"\n\nresult = subprocess.run(\n    [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n     \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n     \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n     \"-d\", json.dumps({\"app_id\": APP_ID, \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET})],\n    capture_output=True, text=True\n)\ntoken_data = json.loads(result.stdout)\napp_token = token_data.get(\"tenant_access_token\", \"\")\n\nif not app_token:\n    print(\"获取 token 失败，跳过通知\")\n    sys.exit(0)\n\nimport datetime\nnow = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M\")\nmsg = f\"📦 定时备份报告\\n\\n✅ GitHub 推送成功\\n⏰ 时间：{now}\\n📦 备份包：openclaw_backup_{now[:10]}.tar.gz\\n📁 散文件：memory/ 单独提交\"\n\nsubprocess.run(\n    [\"curl\", \"-s\", \"-X\", \"POST\",\n     \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n     \"-H\", f\"Authorization: Bearer {app_token}\",\n     \"-H\", \"Content-Type: application/json\",\n     \"-d\", json.dumps({\n         \"receive_id\": USER_OPEN_ID,\n         \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n         \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": msg})\n     })],\n    capture_output=True\n)\nprint(\"飞书通知已发送\")\nPYEOF\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":140259,"output":1291,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":179407,"cost":{"input":0.042077699999999996,"output":0.0015492,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04589831999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775306556528,"responseId":"06203a3c3450493522beb01b33da83fc"}}
