{"type":"message","id":"5a19250b","parentId":"ed7f543e","timestamp":"2026-04-04T13:05:46.694Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's an at job scheduled for 21:00 today (which is now - it was the reminder to ask about the exam papers). Let me tell the user about both.","thinkingSignature":"3228cf25763d74002d022ddd0ca398f4be10cdadfb6e3f70593bc8b90c5fc96f"},{"type":"text","text":"目前有两个定时任务：\n\n**Crontab（循环）：**\n| 时间 | 任务 |\n|------|------|\n| 每天 03:00 | 执行 `openclaw-backup.sh` 备份到 GitHub + 飞书通知 |\n\n**At 任务（一次性）：**\n| 时间 | 任务 |\n|------|------|\n| 今晚 21:00（已过） | 提醒频哥找兮兮要生物 + 英语考试卷子 |\n\n今晚 21:00 的提醒任务已触发执行，如果你还没收到提醒内容，说明 at 任务执行完了。这次是你自己设的找卷子提醒——要重新设吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":139882,"output":172,"cacheRead":37857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":177911,"cost":{"input":0.0419646,"output":0.0002064,"cacheRead":0.0022714199999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.044442419999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775307938981,"responseId":"06203fa352d0bbfdc5be659fb1edf9e5"}}
