{"type":"message","id":"258cd7f4","parentId":"8c7eafc0","timestamp":"2026-04-04T14:51:26.361Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if keeping both gateway processes would cause any problems. Let me think about this...\n\n1. Two Gateway processes means double memory usage\n2. They might conflict on ports or create duplicate routing\n3. But if they're both running and stable, the older one might just be idle/orphaned\n\nLet me check the status of both processes to understand better.","thinkingSignature":"ca0a37b7e42fbf389dd0992e819861bc40350bbfa0280da019a5e556852b7556"},{"type":"text","text":"两个进程同时跑，可能的问题：\n\n1. **内存浪费**：每个进程都占用 RAM，多一个约多用 100-200MB\n2. **端口冲突**：如果监听同一个端口，可能冲突或不稳定\n3. **状态不一致**：旧进程的任务/状态可能丢失\n\n**但如果现在运行正常**（消息收发没毛病），说明可能已经自动处理好了，旧进程已经是\"僵尸进程\"只占内存不再工作。\n\n你可以观察一下：明天看还是两个进程吗？如果一直两个，说明旧进程没退出；如果只剩一个就没事了。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":193,"cacheRead":172611,"cacheWrite":528,"totalTokens":173462,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0002316,"cacheRead":0.010356659999999998,"cacheWrite":0.00019800000000000002,"total":0.010825259999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775314275749,"responseId":"062058647f673cfc6d803700c1d33377"}}
